 "text": "Tir na nOg is the Land of Youth of the Irish Otherworld. The old gods, named the Tuatha De Danann, were banished to this realm and became the fairies of older lore. No one ages in Tir na nOg. Its people dance and sing in a land that never ends. A way in runs below the water of Lough Gur.",
